source: crates/navree-orm/tests/relations/sql.rs
expression: "per_dialect(|dialect|\n{\n    deal().activities().where_(Activity::KIND.eq(\"call\")).or_where(Activity::MINUTES.gt(30)).latest().to_sql(dialect)\n})"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "activities"."id", "activities"."deal_id", "activities"."kind", "activities"."minutes", "activities"."created_at", "activities"."updated_at" FROM "activities" WHERE "activities"."deal_id" = $1 AND "activities"."deal_id" IS NOT NULL AND ("activities"."kind" = $2 OR "activities"."minutes" > $3) ORDER BY "activities"."created_at" DESC
  values: [BigInt(Some(7)), String(Some("call")), BigInt(Some(30))]
